/// Wiki Doc sources:
///   - https://wiki.osdev.org/Security#Rings
///
/// User program: runs `cli`, a privileged instruction. In ring 3 the CPU
/// raises #GP and the kernel kills the process.

/// Tries to disable interrupts.
fn main() {
    print("trying cli in ring 3...")
    cli()
    print("interrupts are off?!")
}
